nherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-boolean.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"boolean\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.FluidTest / </span>Ccc.B7.DE10</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Vomiting Everything</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-boolean\">boolean</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/extension-questionnaire-hidden.html\" title=\"Is a hidden item\"><img src=\"icon-qi-hidden.png\" alt=\"\"/></a><img src=\"icon-qi-hidden.png\" alt=\"\"/><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/extension-questionnaire-choiceorientation.html\" title=\"Orientation: horizontal \"><img src=\"icon-qi-horizontal.png\" alt=\"\"/></a><img src=\"icon-qi-horizontal.png\" alt=\"\"/></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck11.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.DE08\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.FluidTest / </span>Ccc.B22.DE08</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Oral Fluid Test Results</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Options: <a href=\"#opt-item.Ccc.B22.DE08\">5 options</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck100.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.DE08-help\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-display.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"display\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.FluidTest / Ccc.B22.DE08 / </span>Ccc.B22.DE08-help</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">If a child is unconscious do not try to carry out an oral fluid test (Exact wording &lt;span class=\"caps\"&gt;TBC&lt;/span&gt;) &amp;#8211; Pop Up&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;If a breastfeeding assessment and an Oral Fluid test is recommended for a child that is only breastfed then a pop up is required to ensure that the health care worker observes the signs for both and provides results for both tests. &lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;Oral Fluid Test&lt;br /&gt;\nIf it is not possible to perform an oral fluid test, the health care worker should assume that the child is vomiting everything&lt;br /&gt;\nFor a child under 6 months the health care worker can offer for the mother to breastfeed instead of receiving fluids&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;Caution: Do not force fluids into an unconscious child , it can be dangerous. The fluid can cause them to choke or the fluid can go into their lungs. &lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;Pop up box to be made available with instructions on how to carry out an oral fluid test.&lt;br /&gt;\nAdditional information &lt;span class=\"caps\"&gt;TBC&lt;/span&gt;</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-display\">display</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.DE14\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.FluidTest / </span>Ccc.B22.DE14</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">null</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">1..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Options: <a href=\"#opt-item.Ccc.B22.DE14\">1 option</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.DE14a\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-boolean.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"boolean\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.FluidTest / </span>Ccc.B22.DE14a</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Completely Unable to Drink or Vomits Immediately / Everything</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-boolean\">boolean</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/extension-questionnaire-hidden.html\" title=\"Is a hidden item\"><img src=\"icon-qi-hidden.png\" alt=\"\"/></a><img src=\"icon-qi-hidden.png\" alt=\"\"/><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/extension-questionnaire-choiceorientation.html\" title=\"Orientation: horizontal \"><img src=\"icon-qi-horizontal.png\" alt=\"\"/></a><img src=\"icon-qi-horizontal.png\" alt=\"\"/></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.DE15\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-boolean.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"boolean\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.FluidTest / </span>Ccc.B22.DE15</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Has the Child had anything to drink today?</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-boolean\">boolean</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/extension-questionnaire-choiceorientation.html\" title=\"Orientation: horizontal \"><img src=\"icon-qi-horizontal.png\" alt=\"\"/></a><img src=\"icon-qi-horizontal.png\" alt=\"\"/></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.DE16\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.FluidTest / </span>Ccc.B22.DE16</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">How did the child last drink</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Options: <a href=\"#opt-item.Ccc.B22.DE16\">5 options</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven